          contents of _d_i_r_1 itself are level 1.  A bare -rr with no
          _n limits the copy to level 1 (no recursion into sub-
          directories).  Without -rr, ccppddiirr recurs without limit.

     -ss_n_a_m_e
          Do not copy _n_a_m_e, a pathname relative to _d_i_r_1. May be
          repeated to suppress more than one name.

     -tt   Test only: report what would be done (implies -ee and
